CASE P13 sha256-standard-vectors
source TextWireExperimentBlueprint.md:46; TextWireDesign.md:51
arms A B C
input bytes hex empty
expect sha256 e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855
